WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.350
When gate G one passes, leadership
can see a foundation that holds.

2
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.812
Everyone signs in with multifactor.

3
00:00:06.812 --> 00:00:11.599
Administration is scoped by attributes
instead of a tree nobody wrote down.

4
00:00:11.599 --> 00:00:14.525
Emergency access is governed and tested.

5
00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:17.714
HR is driving identity for
a first group of people,

6
00:00:17.714 --> 00:00:22.613
and the core servers and addresses are
under management, all with zero drift.

7
00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:25.151
That's what the pilot
division builds on next.

8
00:00:25.151 --> 00:00:29.338
The last episode steps back from
the mechanics to the meeting itself.

9
00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:35.280
Episode 4, Making the Case at Your Agency,
turns all of this into a one-page ask.
